@title Castlevania - Aria of Sorrow (USA)
@file Castlevania - Aria of Sorrow (U) [!].gba
@game A2CE
@chip SRAM_F (FRAM)
@status wip: reaches gameplay in Castle Corridor (a few rooms in, after picking up the Short Sword); the game writes only its header at boot and nothing at New Game/name entry, so the first real save needs Soma to reach the first save room. Explored live: holding RIGHT with A taps walks through the first corridor rooms, then a stone pillar blocks the ledge (paths go up/down stairs on the left). A human should record: New Game, name, skip dialog, walk to the first save room, touch the save statue, quit after "saved". [load]: Select Data shows the file; pick it to resume in the save room.

[new]
wait 600
press START
until text "GAME START" timeout=600 every=10
wait 60
checkpoint title
press A
until text "Select Data" timeout=300 every=5
wait 60
press A
until text "NEW GAME" timeout=300 every=5
wait 60
checkpoint select_data
press A
until text "DEL" timeout=300 every=5
wait 30
checkpoint name_entry
press A after=20
press A after=20
press START after=20
until text "2035" timeout=1200 every=10
checkpoint intro
# the opening scene: taps of A advance the dialog; RIGHT held walks Soma out
# of the courtyard once play starts
hold RIGHT
mash A until text "Corridor" timeout=9000 every=47
release
checkpoint castle_corridor window=10
